# ─── Google Calendar (Optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# See docs/google-calendar-setup.md for setup steps
# 1. Go to: https://console.cloud.google.com
# 2. Create project → Enable Calendar API → OAuth Consent Screen → Create OAuth credentials
